WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.650
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:40.920 --> 00:41.560
Qian Yichuan.

3
00:42.159 --> 00:43.240
What happened to you?

4
00:43.640 --> 00:44.600
Ma Guowen sent some thugs

5
00:45.359 --> 00:46.280
to beat him up.

6
00:47.200 --> 00:48.960
While we were in the hospital,

7
00:49.200 --> 00:50.640
they pried his dorm door open

8
00:51.640 --> 00:52.359
and took the account books

9
00:52.960 --> 00:54.560
along with all the evidence.

10
00:57.280 --> 00:58.359
We came to see you today

11
00:59.039 --> 01:00.159
just to let you know,

12
01:02.240 --> 01:03.320
about that documentary,

13
01:04.319 --> 01:06.079
you must be under immense pressure.

14
01:08.319 --> 01:09.120
Still, we hope

15
01:09.120 --> 01:11.120
you'll keep the record of our struggle

16
01:12.560 --> 01:13.879
preserved for now.

17
01:14.760 --> 01:15.519
The way things look now,

18
01:15.519 --> 01:17.200
it probably won't make it into a museum.

19
01:18.519 --> 01:19.079
Either way,

20
01:20.120 --> 01:20.840
just keep it safe.

21
01:21.519 --> 01:22.840
Our kids can watch it someday,

22
01:23.719 --> 01:24.719
so they know when facing this,

23
01:26.120 --> 01:27.200
we put up a fight.

24
01:29.000 --> 01:29.680
We didn't just take it lying down.

25
01:34.359 --> 01:34.799
That's right.

26
01:38.280 --> 01:39.680
We're all behind you.

27
01:40.159 --> 01:40.519
Right.

28
01:40.519 --> 01:42.519
We all support you.

29
01:45.239 --> 01:46.799
We've all left the brewery now.

30
01:47.799 --> 01:48.719
We've got nothing left.

31
01:50.200 --> 01:50.959
We're just counting on you

32
01:51.400 --> 01:52.879
to edit the film,

33
01:54.439 --> 01:55.079
get it broadcast,

34
01:56.159 --> 01:57.280
and bring us some justice.

35
02:02.280 --> 02:03.560
Justice will always prevail.

36
02:06.000 --> 02:07.120
I won't give up.

37
02:13.240 --> 02:14.319
Thank you, Reporter Shen.

38
02:15.199 --> 02:16.240
Sorry for putting you through this.

39
02:18.599 --> 02:19.120
Thank you.

40
02:19.199 --> 02:20.800
Thank you, Reporter Shen.

41
02:20.840 --> 02:21.759
We all believe in you.

42
02:21.840 --> 02:22.439
We all trust you.

43
02:22.520 --> 02:23.000
We believe in you.

44
02:23.000 --> 02:23.439
We're so grateful to you.

45
02:23.680 --> 02:24.319
Please.

46
02:24.840 --> 02:25.599
We're counting on you, Reporter Shen.

47
02:25.800 --> 02:26.759
We believe in you.

48
04:03.520 --> 04:04.879
Stop running off.

49
04:05.080 --> 04:06.120
It'll get me in trouble.

50
04:12.759 --> 04:14.000
You never rest for a second, do you?

51
04:16.600 --> 04:17.680
I'm pretty much fully recovered.

52
04:18.199 --> 04:19.439
Just getting ready to be discharged.

53
04:20.120 --> 04:21.240
What about Li Mingyang,

54
04:21.399 --> 04:22.600
and Sister Miao's situation?

55
04:23.160 --> 04:23.720
Thanks.

56
04:24.519 --> 04:25.079
You're reinstated?

57
04:26.439 --> 04:27.800
If you're back on duty, go solve cases!

58
04:27.800 --> 04:28.600
What are you doing here?

59
04:28.920 --> 04:29.879
I am working a case.

60
04:29.879 --> 04:31.399
Dropped by to check on you, then I'm gone.

61
04:32.800 --> 04:33.720
Pretty clever, aren't you?

62
04:35.120 --> 04:35.959
What I have here

63
04:37.120 --> 04:38.600
is called a trick up my sleeve.

64
04:40.279 --> 04:40.920
Shen Leshui...

65
04:40.920 --> 04:43.120
smashed Li Mingyang's car, right?

66
04:43.600 --> 04:44.160
It worked out great,

67
04:44.160 --> 04:45.639
delivering Li Mingyang right to us.

68
04:46.279 --> 04:47.800
Right now, I'm playing the time gap.

69
04:47.959 --> 04:48.879
Li Mingyang is inside,

70
04:49.319 --> 04:50.759
and Miao Yuzhu is outside.

71
04:50.959 --> 04:52.279
I went to see Miao Yuzhu,

72
04:53.079 --> 04:54.920
to take them down one by one.

73
04:56.000 --> 04:57.160
Let me tell you,

74
04:57.519 --> 04:59.160
anyone with a guilty conscience

75
04:59.519 --> 05:01.360
always expects the worst from others.

76
05:03.519 --> 05:04.519
Let me teach you a trick.

77
05:04.879 --> 05:05.439
You know what this is?

78
05:05.439 --> 05:06.800
It's called the Prisoner's Dilemma.

79
05:07.079 --> 05:08.959
You set the hook right now,

80
05:09.279 --> 05:10.079
and the whole thing is solved.

81
05:12.279 --> 05:14.920
Qiang never taught you this, did he?

82
05:17.959 --> 05:18.800
Isn't this for me?

83
05:26.560 --> 05:28.040
You think this is Shen Leshui's move?

84
05:56.560 --> 05:58.079
If we were at a restaurant,

85
05:58.319 --> 05:59.560
we could've had a drink together.

86
06:01.160 --> 06:02.519
Our squad has rules.

87
06:03.279 --> 06:04.040
No drinking.

88
06:05.560 --> 06:06.680
Right, I forgot.

89
06:07.279 --> 06:09.160
You're a stickler for rules.

90
06:09.279 --> 06:10.519
Coming to visit you this time,

91
06:10.519 --> 06:11.959
I had approval from the higher-ups, you know.

92
06:13.199 --> 06:13.879
I get it, I get it.

93
06:14.399 --> 06:16.439
Next time I'll try to find a comfier spot,

94
06:17.079 --> 06:20.000
so you needn't apply to watch me stand.

95
06:21.240 --> 06:22.839
Sounds like you never had to stand.

96
06:23.040 --> 06:24.519
Must've been a model student growing up.

97
06:24.959 --> 06:25.519
Have a seat.

98
06:50.240 --> 06:51.160
I forgive you.

99
06:55.199 --> 06:56.600
I haven't even apologized.

100
07:04.680 --> 07:06.199
The reason I couldn't

101
07:06.759 --> 07:08.519
let Liu Xuemei's death go...

102
07:09.240 --> 07:10.439
is because that day,

103
07:13.079 --> 07:14.680
she rode in my father's car

104
07:15.959 --> 07:17.879
from Qingzhou to Lacheng.

105
07:20.879 --> 07:22.079
I remember it so clearly.

106
07:22.439 --> 07:24.040
It was snowing heavily that morning.

107
07:25.879 --> 07:27.959
I watched his little red car

108
07:30.279 --> 07:31.319
get farther and farther away,

109
07:31.519 --> 07:32.319
farther and farther.

110
07:35.000 --> 07:37.120
I was holding up a meat bun,

111
07:38.800 --> 07:40.439
wanting him to eat it before leaving.

112
07:43.639 --> 07:44.959
I couldn't stop him.

113
07:55.800 --> 07:57.519
That very night, he

114
07:59.399 --> 08:00.000
died.

115
08:02.000 --> 08:03.319
Along with Liu Xuemei.

116
08:05.600 --> 08:07.959
Both causes of death were tied to alcohol.

117
08:08.959 --> 08:10.279
Liu Xuemei

118
08:11.160 --> 08:14.319
froze to death from drunken hypothermia.

119
08:15.720 --> 08:17.240
My father was

120
08:17.759 --> 08:19.079
drunk driving.

121
08:19.519 --> 08:20.319
A car crash.

122
08:29.160 --> 08:30.680
My dad drove a taxi.

123
08:31.120 --> 08:32.840
To stay ready for work,

124
08:34.879 --> 08:36.039
he never touched a drop.

125
08:38.360 --> 08:39.639
Not a single drop!

126
08:40.799 --> 08:42.759
Liu Xuemei was a Beer Taster.

127
08:42.759 --> 08:45.519
To keep her sense of taste sharp,

128
08:46.679 --> 08:47.600
she couldn't drink either.

129
08:51.759 --> 08:53.120
Two people who never drank

130
08:53.120 --> 08:56.320
died drunk on the very same day.

131
08:56.320 --> 08:57.519
Isn't that strange?

132
08:57.879 --> 08:59.039
Shouldn't it be investigated?

133
09:04.519 --> 09:05.240
I'm sorry.

134
09:18.519 --> 09:19.440
Just this one thing.

135
09:22.879 --> 09:23.919
Just this one thing.

136
09:25.879 --> 09:28.519
I've thought about it since I was eight.

137
09:33.080 --> 09:34.960
It's been like a mountain,

138
09:35.360 --> 09:37.320
weighing on my chest for over a decade.

139
09:51.159 --> 09:52.080
So you suspect me,

140
09:52.159 --> 09:53.159
you think I'm acting weird.

141
09:53.159 --> 09:53.879
I guess...

142
09:54.679 --> 09:55.360
that makes sense.

143
09:58.919 --> 09:59.559
You...

144
10:00.720 --> 10:01.759
becoming a cop...

145
10:02.519 --> 10:03.840
does it have to do with this, too—

146
10:03.840 --> 10:05.039
Me becoming a cop,

147
10:05.720 --> 10:07.519
from Qingzhou to Lacheng,

148
10:08.720 --> 10:09.600
every single thing,

149
10:09.600 --> 10:10.120
just... just...

150
10:10.120 --> 10:10.799
all of this,

151
10:10.799 --> 10:12.000
it's all tied to this.

152
10:16.679 --> 10:18.159
I want to find the truth.

153
10:21.279 --> 10:22.639
Ever since Ma Guowen died,

154
10:22.639 --> 10:24.679
I feel I'm getting closer to the truth.

155
10:27.159 --> 10:28.320
I will definitely find it.

156
10:39.799 --> 10:40.360
By the way,

157
10:40.919 --> 10:42.720
I looked into that threat letter.

158
10:42.720 --> 10:44.919
It wasn't Li Mingyang or Miao Yuzhu.

159
10:45.399 --> 10:46.360
No need to check.

160
10:47.360 --> 10:48.919
It actually works in my favor.

161
10:50.159 --> 10:52.639
If I'm just the one who reported it,

162
10:53.679 --> 10:56.279
I won't get to touch the case again.

163
10:57.039 --> 10:59.200
But if another case involves me,

164
11:00.279 --> 11:02.039
I'll have a chance to stay close to you

165
11:02.440 --> 11:03.720
and find out more.

166
11:09.799 --> 11:11.039
Why would you do that?

167
11:11.600 --> 11:12.720
When people run into a homicide,

168
11:12.720 --> 11:14.080
they can't get away fast enough.

169
11:14.080 --> 11:15.759
Why do you keep throwing yourself into it?

170
11:21.759 --> 11:22.879
Is this your...

171
11:23.200 --> 11:25.159
journalistic instinct,

172
11:26.519 --> 11:27.360
or... or is it...

173
11:28.080 --> 11:28.759
or did you...

174
11:28.759 --> 11:29.919
Did you smell money?

175
11:33.159 --> 11:34.799
I know you're selling your house.

176
11:34.799 --> 11:36.000
I know you're broke.

177
11:40.759 --> 11:41.200
I...

178
11:42.440 --> 11:43.200
I admit it.

179
11:44.519 --> 11:45.320
Lately...

180
11:47.440 --> 11:48.519
I've really been strapped for cash.

181
11:51.679 --> 11:53.080
Everyone goes through tough times.

182
11:57.879 --> 12:00.360
The day before I came back to Lacheng,

183
12:03.720 --> 12:05.759
I spent my 40th birthday all alone.

184
12:09.799 --> 12:11.039
Drowning in debt,

185
12:11.039 --> 12:12.480
with no idea how to pay it off.

186
12:18.519 --> 12:19.399
For months,

187
12:20.559 --> 12:22.600
I haven't made a single dime.

188
12:24.840 --> 12:26.000
Rent went up again,

189
12:27.840 --> 12:28.919
and I couldn't afford it.

190
12:33.759 --> 12:35.000
Everyone has it rough.

191
12:36.960 --> 12:39.240
Who'd help a worthless guy

192
12:39.519 --> 12:40.559
get through a crisis?

193
12:44.120 --> 12:45.519
That night, I made up my mind

194
12:47.000 --> 12:50.159
to give up those unrealistic dreams.

195
12:51.320 --> 12:52.840
As long as I can pay off the debt, it's fine.

196
12:54.440 --> 12:56.000
So I returned to Lacheng to sell my place.

197
12:58.240 --> 13:00.320
Right after coming back, I ran into Ma Guowen.

198
13:02.240 --> 13:04.320
I thought I hit the jackpot.

199
13:06.639 --> 13:07.720
I must've been out of my mind.

200
13:14.960 --> 13:15.799
40 years old.

201
13:25.600 --> 13:26.559
At 30, you stand on your own.

202
13:27.840 --> 13:28.960
At 40, you have no doubts.

203
13:31.000 --> 13:31.840
What about at 50?

204
13:35.279 --> 13:35.639
Come on,

205
13:35.639 --> 13:37.279
who came up with these numbers anyway?

206
13:39.720 --> 13:40.759
If you ask me,

207
13:40.919 --> 13:42.039
as long as you're alive,

208
13:42.519 --> 13:43.840
and as long as you still have desires,

209
13:44.879 --> 13:46.519
you'll always be confused at any age.

210
13:48.639 --> 13:49.440
Or in trouble.

211
13:49.960 --> 13:51.679
I mean the kind you bring on yourself.

212
13:53.639 --> 13:54.840
First, you're confused,

213
13:55.879 --> 13:56.840
and then...

214
13:57.519 --> 13:58.240
you run into deep trouble.

215
14:03.879 --> 14:05.519
Misfortune may be a blessing in disguise.

216
14:05.840 --> 14:06.519
Look at it from another angle.

217
14:06.519 --> 14:07.519
Maybe it's a good thing.

218
14:07.759 --> 14:09.120
Don't bother comforting me.

219
14:10.879 --> 14:12.360
I've had so much bad luck,

220
14:12.639 --> 14:13.279
I'm used to it.

221
14:28.120 --> 14:29.120
Shen Leshui.

222
14:30.000 --> 14:31.240
I gave you this assignment in the first place

223
14:31.600 --> 14:33.919
to give a young person like you a chance,

224
14:34.399 --> 14:35.519
and because you told me

225
14:35.559 --> 14:37.000
you'd capture the workers' smiling faces.

226
14:37.000 --> 14:37.879
You duped me!

227
14:38.159 --> 14:39.159
Once this film airs,

228
14:39.879 --> 14:40.639
our station's

229
14:40.960 --> 14:43.559
our yearly ad revenue goes down the drain!

230
14:43.799 --> 14:44.360
Director,

231
14:44.879 --> 14:45.879
when I said smiling faces,

232
14:45.879 --> 14:47.799
I meant the true face of the workers.

233
14:48.120 --> 14:49.279
Don't give me that "truth" crap!

234
14:49.519 --> 14:50.360
What is "truth"?

235
14:50.919 --> 14:52.360
Ma Guowen is still

236
14:52.440 --> 14:54.039
the head of Lapi Brewery.

237
14:54.080 --> 14:55.320
That's the truth!

238
14:56.639 --> 14:57.080
Right now,

239
14:57.080 --> 14:57.720
print media,

240
14:57.720 --> 14:58.399
radio,

241
14:58.399 --> 15:00.679
and TV stations are in fierce competition!

242
15:01.440 --> 15:03.080
It's a battlefield without smoke!

243
15:03.519 --> 15:04.320
Yet look at you!

244
15:04.600 --> 15:06.399
A client we nurtured for so many years,

245
15:06.399 --> 15:07.559
such a valuable client,

246
15:07.600 --> 15:08.720
and you just drove them away!

247
15:08.919 --> 15:09.519
Seriously,

248
15:10.080 --> 15:11.080
who sent you?

249
15:11.519 --> 15:12.399
Are you an undercover mole?

250
15:13.639 --> 15:14.200
Director,

251
15:14.399 --> 15:16.159
you can't just care about commercial profits.

252
15:18.000 --> 15:18.759
Let me tell you,

253
15:19.519 --> 15:20.200
Lapi Brewery

254
15:20.399 --> 15:21.720
is the pride of our entire city.

255
15:22.080 --> 15:23.759
It's not something you can just smear!

256
15:24.240 --> 15:24.879
Discordant voices

257
15:25.519 --> 15:26.679
cannot appear in this film!

258
15:28.679 --> 15:29.240
Come in!

259
15:31.399 --> 15:32.519
Miao Yuzhu, get over here!

260
15:33.639 --> 15:34.639
Have you lost your mind too?

261
15:35.399 --> 15:36.519
Giving her the tapes without permission!

262
15:36.840 --> 15:38.120
I'm docking your bonus for the whole year!

263
15:38.639 --> 15:39.840
Director, don't blame Xiao Miao.

264
15:40.440 --> 15:41.519
I asked her for them.

265
15:42.000 --> 15:42.840
Dock my bonus instead!

266
15:45.360 --> 15:46.120
Shen Leshui,

267
15:47.080 --> 15:48.279
I'll give you one more chance.

268
15:48.960 --> 15:50.120
Follow my script

269
15:50.120 --> 15:50.879
and re-edit it.

270
15:51.759 --> 15:53.039
No sneaking in your personal agenda!

271
15:53.600 --> 15:54.159
Also,

272
15:54.840 --> 15:56.720
the thirty tapes approved by the station,

273
15:57.279 --> 15:58.039
plus the three

274
15:58.200 --> 15:59.159
Xiao Miao gave you without permission...

275
15:59.399 --> 16:00.120
Once you're done editing,

276
16:00.279 --> 16:01.000
hand them all over!

277
16:01.720 --> 16:02.759
And whatever you shot yourself,

278
16:03.120 --> 16:04.080
turn that in as well.

279
16:05.840 --> 16:07.279
Someone else paid for those.

280
16:07.799 --> 16:08.440
I don't have them.

281
16:08.879 --> 16:09.759
Can't hand them over.

282
16:09.960 --> 16:10.519
You...!

283
16:15.159 --> 16:15.720
Fine.

284
16:16.279 --> 16:17.200
You must guarantee

285
16:17.519 --> 16:19.000
they never leak out.

286
16:19.519 --> 16:20.879
Go back and write a letter of commitment.

287
16:21.639 --> 16:22.360
Let me tell you,

288
16:22.600 --> 16:24.279
if any tape leaks,

289
16:24.639 --> 16:25.639
you take full responsibility!

290
16:35.960 --> 16:37.200
Watch from the back and learn.

291
16:39.080 --> 16:40.279
Cut this whole section.

292
16:42.240 --> 16:43.240
We can keep this.

293
16:44.120 --> 16:45.360
Who asked you?

294
16:45.519 --> 16:46.519
Are you accountable to the station,

295
16:46.519 --> 16:47.679
or am I?

296
16:48.159 --> 16:48.799
Out, out, out.

297
16:49.159 --> 16:49.759
Director...

298
16:49.759 --> 16:50.279
We really can keep this.

299
16:50.279 --> 16:51.159
This is just great.

300
16:51.200 --> 16:51.799
Get out.

301
17:24.000 --> 17:24.839
Liu Tieping.

302
17:25.519 --> 17:26.400
What is it?

303
17:26.680 --> 17:27.720
My master and the others are here.

304
17:29.359 --> 17:30.079
They're here, they're here.

305
17:30.119 --> 17:30.680
Come on.

306
17:30.839 --> 17:31.519
Listen to me, okay?

307
17:33.160 --> 17:33.839
Master.

308
17:34.799 --> 17:35.440
Xiao Shen.

309
17:36.039 --> 17:36.839
Off work?

310
17:37.599 --> 17:38.279
Director Cheng.

311
17:39.559 --> 17:40.759
Everyone's here.

312
17:41.400 --> 17:42.599
All of us fellow workers...

313
17:42.759 --> 17:43.759
...have been worried about you.

314
17:44.680 --> 17:45.559
Wanted to check in on you.

315
17:45.599 --> 17:46.240
Check in on you.

316
17:48.839 --> 17:49.680
What's wrong?

317
17:50.960 --> 17:53.160
You seem a bit down.

318
17:53.400 --> 17:54.359
It's nothing.

319
17:55.799 --> 17:56.519
It's just...

320
17:58.519 --> 18:01.160
They sent someone to edit *Malt Kingdom*.

321
18:02.000 --> 18:03.039
After all...

322
18:03.680 --> 18:04.839
it's my first time working solo.

323
18:06.400 --> 18:08.240
I don't have the final cut.

324
18:09.119 --> 18:10.319
What does that mean?

325
18:10.400 --> 18:11.599
Yeah, what does that mean?

326
18:12.960 --> 18:14.799
I get it, I get it.

327
18:15.319 --> 18:16.440
We all understand.

328
18:17.799 --> 18:18.880
The station bosses...

329
18:18.960 --> 18:20.039
...want this film...

330
18:20.119 --> 18:20.720
...to turn out well.

331
18:21.039 --> 18:21.440
Right?

332
18:21.640 --> 18:22.119
Turn out well.

333
18:22.319 --> 18:22.720
Right.

334
18:23.000 --> 18:23.559
Got it.

335
18:23.559 --> 18:24.319
Understood, understood.

336
18:24.400 --> 18:26.519
The reason we all came today...

337
18:27.000 --> 18:28.039
...is to ask you...

338
18:30.039 --> 18:31.200
...about buying the factory...

339
18:32.720 --> 18:33.160
...well...

340
18:33.440 --> 18:34.519
...don't put it in the film.

341
18:34.880 --> 18:35.519
Can you do that?

342
18:35.839 --> 18:36.400
Leave it out.

343
18:36.400 --> 18:37.039
Right, right, right.

344
18:37.039 --> 18:37.519
Leave it out.

345
18:37.680 --> 18:38.640
Qian Yichuan...

346
18:38.640 --> 18:39.880
...and Tu Chunyan are different.

347
18:40.359 --> 18:41.359
They've got nothing to lose.

348
18:42.039 --> 18:42.519
But us...

349
18:42.880 --> 18:44.519
...us frontline workers...

350
18:44.680 --> 18:45.519
...we can't take that hit.

351
18:46.440 --> 18:46.880
If...

352
18:48.240 --> 18:49.400
...once your piece airs...

353
18:49.880 --> 18:51.200
...even active workers will be laid off.

354
18:51.880 --> 18:52.599
And those already laid off...

355
18:52.839 --> 18:54.279
...who would dare hire them?

356
18:54.559 --> 18:55.559
"Just a bunch of troublemakers."

357
18:55.559 --> 18:56.119
Right?

358
18:57.960 --> 18:58.519
Look...

359
18:58.640 --> 18:59.880
I can't lose my job.

360
19:00.279 --> 19:01.599
I rely on this paycheck.

361
19:01.960 --> 19:03.400
If I get laid off...

362
19:04.000 --> 19:05.119
...how am I supposed to survive?

363
19:05.200 --> 19:05.599
Exactly.

364
19:05.599 --> 19:06.640
I can't be laid off either.

365
19:06.640 --> 19:08.440
Reporter Shen, my family relies on me!

366
19:08.440 --> 19:09.000
Quiet down!

367
19:09.000 --> 19:09.799
That factory buyout...

368
19:09.839 --> 19:10.799
...please don't put it in the film.

369
19:10.799 --> 19:11.519
Please leave it out.

370
19:11.519 --> 19:12.839
Reporter Shen, please help us out.

371
19:14.079 --> 19:14.519
Thank you so much.

372
19:14.519 --> 19:15.119
Take these eggs.

373
19:15.519 --> 19:16.279
Please take them, take them.

374
19:16.279 --> 19:17.240
We're counting on you.

375
19:17.279 --> 19:18.160
Please, we're begging you.

376
19:18.279 --> 19:19.079
Just let it slide.

377
19:19.079 --> 19:20.319
We can't lose this job.

378
19:20.319 --> 19:20.799
Understood.

379
19:20.799 --> 19:21.279
Yes.

380
19:21.440 --> 19:22.400
Quiet down, quiet down.

381
19:23.000 --> 19:25.240
Reporter Shen surely understands.

382
19:25.519 --> 19:26.240
He knows what to do.

383
19:26.599 --> 19:27.920
We know you're a good person.

384
19:27.960 --> 19:28.839
Thanks for your hard work, Reporter Shen.

385
19:28.839 --> 19:29.440
Get some rest.

386
19:30.200 --> 19:31.000
Thank you, thank you.

387
19:37.160 --> 19:38.839
When *Malt Kingdom* won that award,

388
19:40.000 --> 19:41.359
I cried my eyes out.

389
19:42.440 --> 19:43.960
People thought it was from excitement,

390
19:45.319 --> 19:46.680
but I was truly heartbroken.

391
19:49.720 --> 19:50.680
Heartbroken for those

392
19:51.240 --> 19:53.039
who had placed their hopes in me,

393
19:54.319 --> 19:55.559
and for myself.

394
19:59.680 --> 20:01.839
So at that moment, I swore

395
20:02.680 --> 20:04.160
I'd definitely become a director

396
20:04.559 --> 20:06.160
who had final cut.

397
20:07.359 --> 20:09.680
I've worked toward that all these years.

398
20:10.640 --> 20:12.559
Never thought I'd get burned so badly.

399
20:12.559 --> 20:13.319
At my age,

400
20:13.319 --> 20:14.880
getting fooled by some petty thief.

401
20:20.759 --> 20:21.880
Easy, easy, don't get worked up.

402
20:24.319 --> 20:25.599
Petty thieves these days,

403
20:25.720 --> 20:26.440
these young punks,

404
20:27.640 --> 20:29.359
their minds really do move fast.

405
20:30.039 --> 20:31.119
When we get older,

406
20:31.119 --> 20:33.119
we just can't keep up with them.

407
20:42.359 --> 20:43.599
What am I even saying?

408
20:46.799 --> 20:47.599
I'm sorry.

409
20:51.240 --> 20:52.079
It's in the past.

410
20:53.319 --> 20:54.359
What's done is done.

411
20:54.759 --> 20:55.279
Alright?

412
20:56.880 --> 20:58.400
My grandma always had a saying:

413
20:58.400 --> 21:00.400
always remember people's kindness,

414
21:01.160 --> 21:02.160
and don't hold grudges.

415
21:05.039 --> 21:05.880
Grandma Gao...

416
21:08.039 --> 21:10.519
I lied to her that day, too.

417
21:16.039 --> 21:18.000
You? Your mental age

418
21:18.279 --> 21:19.400
is seventeen or eighteen at best.

419
21:21.240 --> 21:22.680
You think you could fool her?

420
21:23.279 --> 21:24.599
The minute you walked out that day,

421
21:24.960 --> 21:26.400
she called me right up.

422
21:26.960 --> 21:28.240
She told me to watch out for you,

423
21:28.240 --> 21:30.119
said you didn't look like a good guy.

424
21:34.960 --> 21:36.039
Let me tell you,

425
21:36.519 --> 21:39.079
the people's eyes are sharp.

426
21:39.720 --> 21:41.440
My grandma might be old,

427
21:41.440 --> 21:42.279
can barely read the words,

428
21:42.400 --> 21:43.720
but she's never wrong about people.

429
21:53.960 --> 21:54.640
All right.

430
21:55.640 --> 21:57.240
Feel better getting that off your chest?

431
21:58.640 --> 21:59.680
Done venting?

432
22:04.839 --> 22:06.119
I'll take off then.

433
22:06.359 --> 22:08.039
I've got a million other things to check.

434
22:08.799 --> 22:10.799
I'll keep looking into that threat letter.

435
22:11.279 --> 22:12.200
After all, you did report it.

436
22:13.519 --> 22:14.359
Gao.

437
22:15.720 --> 22:16.839
Over a decade ago...

438
22:17.960 --> 22:19.519
I got a threatening letter, too.

439
22:21.279 --> 22:21.880
Shen.

440
22:22.119 --> 22:22.920
There's a letter here for you.

441
22:23.599 --> 22:24.440
Thanks, sir.

442
22:36.039 --> 22:36.880
Who threatened you?

443
23:21.519 --> 23:22.559
You're unbelievable.

444
23:23.359 --> 23:24.359
You took what happened back then

445
23:24.359 --> 23:25.440
and sold it out for cash, didn't you?

446
23:34.119 --> 23:35.400
Over ten years ago,

447
23:36.119 --> 23:37.000
right in front of this door,

448
23:37.599 --> 23:38.759
we trusted you once.

449
23:40.559 --> 23:41.559
And now,

450
23:42.000 --> 23:43.559
I trusted you again.

451
23:44.599 --> 23:46.519
Do you think we're just a bunch of suckers

452
23:46.519 --> 23:47.440
you can fool whenever you want?

453
23:47.559 --> 23:48.759
Think we're easy targets?

454
23:49.440 --> 23:50.759
Sell your house and get the hell out.

455
23:51.160 --> 23:52.559
I never want to see you again.

456
23:54.359 --> 23:55.279
I'm sorry.

457
23:56.279 --> 23:57.119
Hypocrite.

458
23:57.680 --> 23:59.160
Do you have any shame at all?

459
23:59.400 --> 23:59.839
Get out!

460
24:00.440 --> 24:01.720
Are you even human?

461
24:31.880 --> 24:32.680
Cheng.

462
24:32.920 --> 24:34.200
Introduce yourself.

463
24:34.319 --> 24:34.759
Okay.

464
24:36.519 --> 24:37.759
I'm Cheng Youtian,

465
24:38.519 --> 24:40.079
head of the bottling workshop.

466
24:43.319 --> 24:44.759
I'm Liu Xuemei.

467
24:45.200 --> 24:46.680
I'm 32 years old,

468
24:46.960 --> 24:50.160
a Beer Taster at state-owned Lapi Brewery.

469
24:50.599 --> 24:52.119
As a Beer Taster,

470
24:52.519 --> 24:54.319
our job is very important.

471
24:54.519 --> 24:55.920
Normally, I can't drink alcohol,

472
24:56.519 --> 24:57.720
or eat heavily seasoned

473
24:57.799 --> 24:59.039
or spicy food.

474
25:00.039 --> 25:01.599
Not that I like that stuff anyway.

475
25:04.400 --> 25:06.559
I really care about my coworkers.

476
25:07.279 --> 25:09.240
They're like family to me.

477
25:09.359 --> 25:11.359
And I really love our brewery.

478
25:13.759 --> 25:14.680
What else should I say?

479
25:15.359 --> 25:15.920
Whatever you like.

480
25:16.200 --> 25:17.039
What else is there?

481
25:18.200 --> 25:20.279
Talk about your dreams, your hobbies...

482
25:20.279 --> 25:21.519
your hopes for the factory.

483
25:21.680 --> 25:22.519
Anything at all.

484
25:23.960 --> 25:24.440
Go on.

485
25:24.559 --> 25:25.640
What kind of dreams could I have?

486
25:27.279 --> 25:29.319
I just hope my son

487
25:29.319 --> 25:30.519
gets good grades on his finals.

488
25:30.960 --> 25:33.039
He... He's eight this year.

489
25:33.119 --> 25:35.240
I hope he gets into college someday.

490
25:38.720 --> 25:39.640
That's wonderful.

491
25:40.119 --> 25:41.160
Leave this to Xuemei.

492
25:41.400 --> 25:42.000
Consider it done.

493
25:42.039 --> 25:42.720
Right, right.

494
25:42.920 --> 25:43.759
All right, then.

495
25:43.759 --> 25:44.920
Stop arguing with them.

496
25:44.960 --> 25:45.519
Let's pack it up.

497
25:45.519 --> 25:46.000
Okay.

498
25:46.000 --> 25:46.839
Tell everyone to head back.

499
25:47.559 --> 25:48.039
Got it.

500
26:15.599 --> 26:16.599
Let go of me. I get it.

501
26:16.599 --> 26:17.160
Okay.

502
26:17.160 --> 26:17.720
Let's go.

503
26:32.640 --> 26:33.319
Chen Yuan.

504
26:34.880 --> 26:35.559
What are you doing?

505
26:36.000 --> 26:37.119
You're back.

506
26:37.839 --> 26:38.319
I'm

507
26:38.839 --> 26:39.680
looking for a book.

508
26:40.119 --> 26:41.039
A book?

509
26:43.359 --> 26:44.440
I bought beef pies.

510
26:44.680 --> 26:45.519
Eat them while they're hot.

511
26:45.960 --> 26:47.160
Okay, I'll be right there.

512
26:48.680 --> 26:49.200
Come on, Xiaohu.

513
26:49.200 --> 26:50.319
Go wash your hands first.

514
26:50.359 --> 26:51.519
I'll find your toy train in a bit.

515
27:33.559 --> 27:34.279
Who is it?

516
27:34.359 --> 27:34.880
It's me.

517
28:06.119 --> 28:07.400
I never would've thought

518
28:08.720 --> 28:11.559
a big reporter like you could get conned.

519
28:12.559 --> 28:13.319
Let me tell you,

520
28:13.440 --> 28:14.759
that little bastard better not show his face.

521
28:15.519 --> 28:16.759
I'll smack him every time I see him.

522
28:18.440 --> 28:19.519
That woman across the hall, too.

523
28:21.079 --> 28:21.880
She better stay out of my sight.

524
28:35.519 --> 28:36.440
I kept telling you to leave,

525
28:36.880 --> 28:38.240
but you just refused.

526
28:40.240 --> 28:41.079
Let me tell you,

527
28:41.880 --> 28:42.880
in this world,

528
28:43.039 --> 28:44.759
if anyone truly cares about you,

529
28:45.839 --> 28:46.519
it's your mom.

530
28:47.319 --> 28:48.160
And after her, it's me.

531
28:55.599 --> 28:56.559
So you won't leave, huh?

532
28:58.039 --> 28:58.599
Right.

533
29:03.519 --> 29:04.200
Fine, then.

534
29:06.279 --> 29:08.559
We may not be family on paper,

535
29:09.720 --> 29:11.920
but I'll always look out for you.

536
29:13.680 --> 29:14.240
I've made up my mind.

537
29:15.759 --> 29:17.000
Starting today,

538
29:18.160 --> 29:19.000
wherever you go,

539
29:19.359 --> 29:20.119
I go.

540
29:20.440 --> 29:21.319
I'm staying right here.

541
29:23.200 --> 29:23.839
Don't "what" me!

542
29:24.640 --> 29:26.000
If bad guys show up, I'll take them on.

543
29:26.319 --> 29:27.839
Worst case, we fight to the death.

544
29:28.119 --> 29:28.680
What's the big deal?

545
29:30.200 --> 29:31.519
I... I'm fine now.

546
29:31.559 --> 29:32.200
I'm fine.

547
29:32.519 --> 29:33.599
Just... just hurry home.

548
29:33.599 --> 29:34.640
Just stay by Lili's side.

549
29:35.200 --> 29:36.000
Don't worry about Lili.

550
29:36.240 --> 29:37.799
I took her to her parents' place.

551
29:39.799 --> 29:41.640
Then you definitely can't stay here.

552
29:41.920 --> 29:43.079
Just go. Get out of here.

553
29:43.240 --> 29:44.519
Don't make things harder for me.

554
29:45.240 --> 29:46.720
How am I making things harder?

555
29:47.079 --> 29:48.240
I'll take the couch,

556
29:48.839 --> 29:49.799
and you take the bed.

557
29:50.680 --> 29:51.240
It's fine.

558
29:56.680 --> 29:57.440
Haipeng,

559
29:59.440 --> 30:00.240
thank you.

560
30:02.079 --> 30:02.720
I know that

561
30:03.640 --> 30:05.240
besides my mom,

562
30:06.200 --> 30:07.720
you're the last person who'd ever hurt me.

563
30:09.799 --> 30:11.799
That's why I hope you understand:

564
30:12.400 --> 30:14.640
I have to see this case through.

565
30:17.200 --> 30:19.039
Because over a decade ago, I backed down

566
30:20.079 --> 30:21.359
and let so many people down.

567
30:22.599 --> 30:23.599
Falling for this deception

568
30:24.160 --> 30:25.319
let you all down again.

569
30:27.440 --> 30:28.920
That slap from Tu Chunyan...

570
30:29.400 --> 30:30.519
I had it coming.

571
30:33.160 --> 30:34.920
So much I still haven't figured out.

572
30:36.400 --> 30:37.440
Like Liu Xuemei.

573
30:38.640 --> 30:40.720
I really don't know if she was wronged.

574
30:41.559 --> 30:43.519
So no matter what, I have to stay here.

575
30:43.839 --> 30:45.000
Even if the killer comes after me,

576
30:45.000 --> 30:46.359
I'll demand to know why.

577
30:56.799 --> 30:58.839
If only we could turn back time.

578
31:01.559 --> 31:03.200
None of this would've happened.

579
31:10.839 --> 31:12.759
Too bad you can't turn back time.

580
31:16.640 --> 31:17.359
Right now,

581
31:18.640 --> 31:19.720
that you trust me

582
31:20.720 --> 31:21.640
and I trust you...

583
31:23.319 --> 31:24.519
that's already rare enough.

584
31:28.960 --> 31:29.799
Go on home.

585
31:31.599 --> 31:32.759
I'll lock the door.

586
31:35.319 --> 31:35.960
Don't worry.

587
31:39.079 --> 31:39.680
Head back inside.

588
31:48.200 --> 31:49.200
Call me if anything comes up.

589
31:52.000 --> 31:52.640
Go on.

590
31:54.759 --> 31:55.799
Don't go out unless you have to.

591
31:59.960 --> 32:00.519
I'm heading out.

592
32:11.359 --> 32:12.559
Make sure to lock the door.

593
32:13.720 --> 32:14.519
You be careful too.

594
32:55.200 --> 32:56.039
What did they steal?

595
32:56.440 --> 32:57.920
Discarded footage from Lapi Brewery.

596
33:46.079 --> 33:46.799
Chen Yuan.

597
33:48.039 --> 33:48.720
What are you doing?

598
33:49.400 --> 33:50.559
You're back.

599
33:51.240 --> 33:51.720
I'm...

600
33:52.200 --> 33:53.079
looking for a book.

601
34:06.079 --> 34:08.400
Who actually killed Cao Jun?

602
34:09.719 --> 34:10.719
Cheng Youtian.

603
34:12.079 --> 34:13.320
When Cao Jun was killed,

604
34:13.320 --> 34:15.639
he chatted with a pal at the gas station.

605
34:17.119 --> 34:19.519
When Liu Tieping was killed,

606
34:19.519 --> 34:21.800
he was drinking with Li San and the rest.

607
34:23.239 --> 34:24.519
Chen Qingchun.

608
34:25.119 --> 34:26.679
He crashed into the big sculpture back then.

609
34:27.639 --> 34:28.679
Zhao Haipeng.

610
34:30.119 --> 34:31.760
When the crime happened, Zhao Haipeng

611
34:31.760 --> 34:34.320
playing mahjong with wife and neighbors.

612
34:35.679 --> 34:37.440
They all have alibis.

613
34:38.360 --> 34:42.639
Could the killer be someone off our radar?

614
34:47.280 --> 34:47.920
Xiaoqin.

615
34:48.320 --> 34:49.039
What brings you here?

616
34:55.119 --> 34:55.880
What's wrong?

617
34:57.000 --> 34:58.360
The stuff you left at my place,

618
34:59.280 --> 35:00.440
and the discarded footage you threw away,

619
35:02.199 --> 35:02.960
are all here.

620
35:16.840 --> 35:17.679
None missing, right?

621
35:18.119 --> 35:19.280
Give the tapes back to me.

622
35:19.840 --> 35:20.880
Does Chen Yuan know?

623
35:24.679 --> 35:25.360
These tapes of yours,

624
35:25.360 --> 35:26.320
stored for so many years,

625
35:27.199 --> 35:28.159
could they be damaged?

626
35:28.400 --> 35:28.920
No.

627
35:29.360 --> 35:30.519
I've been watching them every day.

628
35:30.679 --> 35:31.719
These tapes here,

629
35:32.000 --> 35:32.800
they're damaged.

630
35:33.039 --> 35:34.159
I marked them for you.

631
35:34.199 --> 35:34.960
Damaged?

632
36:03.599 --> 36:05.199
Why erase my tapes?

633
36:09.559 --> 36:10.800
When did you find out?

634
36:11.280 --> 36:12.920
Does it matter when I found out?

635
36:16.519 --> 36:17.079
Leshui,

636
36:18.599 --> 36:19.519
tell me.

637
36:20.519 --> 36:22.519
Why did Chen Yuan steal your tapes?

638
36:23.079 --> 36:25.559
Why did he have to delete things from them?

639
36:26.719 --> 36:27.920
Why?

640
36:33.679 --> 36:35.679
He's the man who lies beside me every day.

641
36:36.559 --> 36:38.199
He's Xiaohu's father,

642
36:41.280 --> 36:42.800
the father of my child.

643
36:46.199 --> 36:48.000
I've known him for so many years,

644
36:50.199 --> 36:51.599
and I never imagined

645
36:52.320 --> 36:54.119
he could be such a terrifying person.

646
36:56.360 --> 36:56.960
Leshui,

647
36:57.639 --> 36:58.280
tell me,

648
36:58.280 --> 36:59.559
what am I supposed to do?

649
37:01.360 --> 37:03.639
What should I do, Leshui?

650
37:18.800 --> 37:19.559
Slow down.

651
37:21.719 --> 37:22.159
Did you eat?

652
37:26.000 --> 37:26.599
Chen Yuan.

653
37:39.079 --> 37:39.760
Shen Leshui.

654
37:40.000 --> 37:40.880
What are you doing here?

655
37:42.360 --> 37:43.400
I came to see you.

656
37:44.119 --> 37:44.719
Me?

657
37:46.880 --> 37:47.920
To talk about the tape.

658
37:52.159 --> 37:52.960
Get in the car.

659
38:13.400 --> 38:15.840
You took advantage of me seeing Xiaoqin

660
38:15.840 --> 38:16.760
to break into my place,

661
38:18.000 --> 38:19.079
steal the tapes,

662
38:19.440 --> 38:20.440
and delete the surveillance footage.

663
38:21.679 --> 38:22.719
Several tapes of raw footage...

664
38:22.920 --> 38:24.039
you even erased them.

665
38:26.039 --> 38:27.760
The police are on their way right now.

666
38:31.119 --> 38:32.239
I asked to meet you here

667
38:32.639 --> 38:34.800
because I didn't want the kid and Xiaoqin

668
38:34.800 --> 38:35.920
to see you get taken away by the cops.

669
38:38.599 --> 38:40.159
Let's save each other some face

670
38:40.760 --> 38:42.280
and lay everything out in the open.

671
38:42.920 --> 38:43.559
All right?

672
38:56.440 --> 38:58.519
The 1999 Lapi Brewery beer label.

673
38:59.000 --> 38:59.679
An angel.

674
39:02.920 --> 39:03.800
Looks familiar, doesn't it?

675
39:05.719 --> 39:07.119
This beautiful side profile...

676
39:07.199 --> 39:08.519
reminds me of someone.

677
39:10.039 --> 39:11.039
Liu Xuemei.

678
39:14.760 --> 39:16.880
To paint Liu Xuemei so beautifully,

679
39:18.760 --> 39:20.239
he must have loved her so much.

680
39:31.840 --> 39:33.000
From what I gather,

681
39:33.079 --> 39:34.599
the designer of this beer label

682
39:35.079 --> 39:37.079
submitted it anonymously from Qingzhou.

683
39:39.039 --> 39:41.119
At first, I assumed they were from Qingzhou.

684
39:41.920 --> 39:43.960
But these past couple of days, it hit me.

685
39:44.519 --> 39:45.880
Submitting from Qingzhou

686
39:46.280 --> 39:47.920
doesn't mean they had to be a local.

687
39:48.840 --> 39:50.719
They could just be working in Qingzhou.

688
39:52.639 --> 39:53.320
Chen Yuan.

689
39:54.880 --> 39:56.039
Back then,

690
39:57.079 --> 39:59.360
you worked at Qingzhou Normal University?

691
40:02.239 --> 40:04.280
Liu Xuemei was always running off to Qingzhou.

692
40:05.119 --> 40:06.679
She was going there to see you, wasn't she?

693
40:07.360 --> 40:08.039
Drop it.

694
40:08.880 --> 40:10.519
Going to Qingzhou to pay the deposit,

695
40:11.239 --> 40:12.360
she visited you then too, didn't she?

696
40:12.679 --> 40:13.679
Just stop asking!

697
40:16.400 --> 40:17.079
You...

698
40:17.920 --> 40:19.519
you're that lover of hers.

699
40:27.199 --> 40:27.920
Yes.

700
40:29.440 --> 40:31.039
I'm the one who took the tapes from your place.

701
40:32.519 --> 40:34.000
All I wanted was to know

702
40:34.199 --> 40:35.920
how Xuemei really died.

703
40:36.199 --> 40:38.320
I've bottled this up for over a decade.

704
40:41.519 --> 40:42.880
Everyone dragged her name through the mud,

705
40:43.239 --> 40:44.360
but I never believed any of it.

706
40:45.800 --> 40:47.679
Yet how did Xuemei actually die?

707
40:48.599 --> 40:49.800
She never touched alcohol.

708
40:50.079 --> 40:51.760
Why was she drunk that day?

709
40:52.880 --> 40:54.400
I desperately wanted to know,

710
40:57.239 --> 40:58.719
but had no way of finding out.

711
41:02.639 --> 41:03.840
Until by chance,

712
41:05.159 --> 41:06.519
I heard Xiaoqin mention

713
41:07.719 --> 41:09.639
that you had a lot of discarded footage.

714
41:11.360 --> 41:13.239
I figured Xuemei had to be in there.

715
41:15.519 --> 41:16.719
After all these years,

716
41:17.400 --> 41:19.000
I just wanted to see her.

717
41:22.400 --> 41:24.440
That was my only pathetic thought.

718
41:29.840 --> 41:32.159
In fact, I went looking for you before.

719
41:34.079 --> 41:35.280
I left you a note,

720
41:36.199 --> 41:37.159
asking to meet up.

721
41:39.119 --> 41:40.719
But when I showed up the next day,

722
41:41.440 --> 41:43.079
I saw someone else was there.

723
41:44.079 --> 41:44.639
Stand right there!

724
41:45.679 --> 41:46.400
So later,

725
41:46.400 --> 41:46.960
Don't move!

726
41:48.559 --> 41:50.239
I could only wait until you visited me

727
41:52.199 --> 41:53.320
to take the tapes.

728
42:27.599 --> 42:28.719
Do you know why

729
42:28.719 --> 42:30.400
beer bottles are always green?

730
42:32.239 --> 42:33.079
Why?

731
42:34.079 --> 42:35.320
In the late 19th century,

732
42:36.079 --> 42:38.280
brewers first started using glass bottles.

733
42:39.280 --> 42:41.920
Glassmaking wasn't very advanced back then.

734
42:43.199 --> 42:44.599
Too many ferrous ions

735
42:44.840 --> 42:45.960
made the glass turn green.

736
42:46.559 --> 42:48.559
Later, when the technology improved,

737
42:49.639 --> 42:51.519
the quality of beer in clear bottles

738
42:51.599 --> 42:52.599
actually went downhill.

739
42:54.519 --> 42:56.159
Green glass blocked out the light,

740
42:56.599 --> 42:57.559
and it was cheaper,

741
42:58.440 --> 42:59.880
so they just rolled with the mistake.

742
43:01.440 --> 43:02.440
You know everything, don't you?

743
43:03.199 --> 43:04.039
You bet.

744
43:04.239 --> 43:05.400
I grew up around the smell of beer.

745
43:18.119 --> 43:18.760
All done.

746
43:19.079 --> 43:19.840
You can move now.

747
43:20.199 --> 43:21.079
You can move now.

748
43:27.639 --> 43:28.760
It's drawn really well.

749
43:40.519 --> 43:41.559
Then can you tell us

750
43:41.639 --> 43:43.840
why you erased what was on the tape?

751
43:44.960 --> 43:46.800
It really was an accident.

752
43:46.800 --> 43:48.760
Why would Chen Yuan erase this part?

753
43:49.119 --> 43:50.800
Is that Chen Qingchun in the distance?

754
43:51.199 --> 43:52.519
What's he holding in his hand?

755
43:52.840 --> 43:54.519
No one will ever know now.

756
43:56.280 --> 43:57.719
You can put your mind at ease.

757
43:58.239 --> 43:59.199
Feel free to check.

758
43:59.800 --> 44:00.920
Where were you the day Cao Jun died?

759
44:01.239 --> 44:01.880
Cao Jun?
